<title>SINGAPORE: Cosco Inv. 1st-half net falls 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Cosco Inv. 1st-half net falls 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   3.09  vs   4.03</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (EPS) (cts) 3.09  vs   4.20</p>
<p>    EPS fully diluted (cts)	  2.84  vs    NA</p>
<p>    Turnover			   184.19  vs 121.82</p>
<p>    Interest and other income	1.58  vs   1.26</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   9.60  vs  11.49</p>
<p>    Interest expense		   1.72  vs   1.99</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 4.22  vs   4.55</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     3.66  vs   4.94</p>
<p>    Profit from associates	    nil  vs   0.11</p>
<p>    Tax				    0.39  vs   0.50</p>
<p>    Minorities (expense)	     0.17  vs   0.53</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		     nil  vs   9.32</p>
<p>Note - Cosco Investment (Singapore) Ltd is a diversified shipping company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
